        question: "What is the difference between a <strong>freelance video editor</strong> and <span style='color: #1b1b1b; font-weight: 800;'> Oberstaff<span style='color: #ff66cc'>.</span></span>?",
        answers: ["A <strong>freelance video editor</strong> is typically engaged per hour, project, day rate, or retainer and may balance multiple clients. Oberstaff. sources and evaluates dedicated talent for a defined full-time role, coordinates the international engagement and monthly administration, and supports the ongoing placement under the applicable service terms."]
