    },
    {
        question: "How quickly should revisions and final exports be delivered?",
        answers: ["The right turnaround depends on video length, footage volume, complexity, motion graphics, color work, number of versions, review speed, and the production queue. Your company should define priority levels and target windows for rough cuts, routine revisions, urgent paid-media variants, and final exports during scope definition."]
    },
    {
        question: "How are video editor candidates evaluated?",
        answers: ["Candidates undergo experience screening, portfolio review, role-relevant editing assessment, software validation, storytelling and pacing review, file-workflow evaluation, communication or English assessment when required, and interviews focused on realistic production scenarios."]
    },
    {
        question: "What happens if the editor does not adapt to our brand style or workflow?",
        answers: ["Editing style is subjective, so references, templates, pacing examples, caption rules, brand assets, and feedback standards should be documented during onboarding. If the selected editor still does not meet the agreed expectations after calibration, <span style='color: #1b1b1b; font-weight: 800;'> Oberstaff<span style='color: #ff66cc'>.</span></span> can support a replacement process according to the applicable service terms."]
    },
    {
        question: "Which countries do video editor candidates come from?",
        answers: ["<span style='color: #1b1b1b; font-weight: 800;'> Oberstaff<span style='color: #ff66cc'>.</span></span>  recruits remote professionals across Latin America, including countries such as Colombia, Argentina, Peru, Venezuela, and Mexico, subject to availability, technical requirements, language level, schedule, and the selected service model."]
    },
    {
        question: "How does billing and payroll work for U.S. companies?",
        answers: ["Your company receives a consolidated monthly invoice in U.S. dollars from <span style='color: #1b1b1b; font-weight: 800;'> Oberstaff<span style='color: #ff66cc'>.</span></span> The international contracting and professional payment structure is coordinated according to the selected service model and the professional's country."]
